This block demonstrates how to implement a block using the impure random number generator. This block is used in the example  Examples.Noise.ImpureGenerator .

Code:
block ImpureRandom "Block generating random numbers with the impure random number generator"
  extends Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.SO;
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Period samplePeriod "Sample period for random number generation";
protected
  outer Modelica.Blocks.Noise.GlobalSeed globalSeed;
equation
