This model is a simple model of a bipolar NPN junction transistor according to Ebers-Moll. 
A heating port is added for thermal electric simulation. The heating port is defined in the Modelica.Thermal library. 
A typical parameter set is (the parameter Vt is no longer used):    Bf Br Is Vak Tauf Taur Ccs Cje Cjc Phie Me PHic Mc Gbc Gbe - - A V s s F F F V - V - mS mS 50 0.1 1e-16 0.02 0.12e-9 5e-9 1e-12 0.4e-12 0.5e-12 0.8 0.4 0.8 0.333 1e-15 1e-15   
