The machine is loaded by a quadratic speed dependent load torque.
 Simulate for 2 seconds and plot (versus time): 
dcpm.ia: armature current dcpm.wMechanical: motor's speed dcpm.tauElectrical: motor's torque  Default machine parameters of model DC_PermanentMagnet are used.

