modelica://Modelica.Electrical/DcdcInver:
Modelica.Electrical: DcdcInverter (model)

This is a model of a DC-DC inverter. The level of detail of the DC-DC inverter may be chosen from ideal averaging or switching.  
Reference voltage is limited to actual battery voltage.  
Battery voltage and motor current are measured.

Code:
model DcdcInverter "DC-DC inverter"
  parameter Boolean useIdealInverter = true "Use ideal averaging inverter, otherwise switching inverter";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Frequency fS "Switching frequency";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Time Td = 0.5 / fS "Dead time";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Time Tmf = 2 / fS "Measurement filter time constant";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Voltage VMax "Maximum Voltage";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Time Ti = 1e-6 "Time constant of integral power controller" ;
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Resistance RonT = 1e-05 "Transistor closed resistance" ;
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Conductance GoffT = 1e-05 "Transistor opened conductance" ;
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Voltage VkneeT = 0 "Transistor threshold voltage" ;
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Resistance RonD = 1e-05 "Diode closed resistance" ;
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Conductance GoffD = 1e-05 "Diode opened conductance" ;
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Voltage VkneeD = 0 "Diode threshold voltage" ;
  output Modelica.Units.SI.Power pDC = vDC * iDC "DC power (from battery)";
  output Modelica.Units.SI.Power pMot = vMot * iMot "Power to motor";
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.PositivePin pin_pBat ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.NegativePin pin_nBat ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.PositivePin pin_pMot ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.NegativePin pin_nMot ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealInput vRef ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealOutput vDC ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealOutput iDC ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealOutput vMot ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealOutput iMot ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sensors.VoltageSensor vDCSensor ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sensors.CurrentSensor iMotSensor ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Nonlinear.VariableLimiter variableLimiter ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Math.Gain gain(k = -1) ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.FirstOrder vDCFilter(k = 1, T = Tmf, initType = Modelica.Blocks.Types.Init.InitialOutput, y_start = VMax) ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.FirstOrder iMotFilter(k = 1, T = Tmf, initType = Modelica.Blocks.Types.Init.InitialOutput, y_start = 0) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.ControlledDCDrives.Utilities.IdealDcDc idealDcDc(Td = Td, Ti = Ti) if useIdealInverter ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Machines.Examples.ControlledDCDrives.Utilities.SwitchingDcDc switchingDcDc(fS = fS, VMax = VMax, RonT = RonT, GoffT = GoffT, VkneeT = VkneeT, RonD = RonD, GoffD = GoffD, VkneeD = VkneeD) if not useIdealInverter ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sensors.CurrentSensor iDCSensor ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sensors.VoltageSensor vMotSensor ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.FirstOrder vMotFilter(k = 1, T = Tmf, initType = Modelica.Blocks.Types.Init.InitialOutput, y_start = 0) ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.FirstOrder iDCFilter(k = 1, T = Tmf, initType = Modelica.Blocks.Types.Init.InitialOutput, y_start = 0) ;
equation
  connect(iMotSensor.p, pin_nMot) ;
  connect(vRef, variableLimiter.u) ;
  connect(gain.y, variableLimiter.limit2) ;
  connect(iMotSensor.i, iMotFilter.u) ;
  connect(iMotFilter.y, iMot) ;
  connect(vDCFilter.y, vDC) ;
  connect(vDCFilter.y, gain.u) ;
  connect(vDCFilter.y, variableLimiter.limit1) ;
  connect(variableLimiter.y, idealDcDc.vRef) ;
  connect(variableLimiter.y, switchingDcDc.vRef) ;
  connect(vDCFilter.y, switchingDcDc.vMax) ;
  connect(iDCSensor.p, pin_pBat) ;
  connect(iMotSensor.n, switchingDcDc.pin_nMot) ;
  connect(vMotFilter.y, vMot) ;
  connect(iDCSensor.i, iDCFilter.u) ;
  connect(iDCFilter.y, iDC) ;
  connect(idealDcDc.pin_pBat, iDCSensor.n) ;
  connect(pin_nBat, switchingDcDc.pin_nBat) ;
  connect(pin_nBat, idealDcDc.pin_nBat) ;
  connect(iDCSensor.n, switchingDcDc.pin_pBat) ;
  connect(iMotSensor.n, idealDcDc.pin_nMot) ;
  connect(idealDcDc.pin_pMot, pin_pMot) ;
  connect(pin_pMot, switchingDcDc.pin_pMot) ;
  connect(pin_nBat, vDCSensor.n) ;
  connect(pin_pBat, vDCSensor.p) ;
  connect(pin_nMot, vMotSensor.n) ;
  connect(pin_pMot, vMotSensor.p) ;
  connect(vMotFilter.u, vMotSensor.v) ;
  connect(vDCFilter.u, vDCSensor.v) ;

end DcdcInverter;

modelica://Modelica.Electrical/IdealDcDc:
Modelica.Electrical: IdealDcDc (model)

This is a model of an ideal DC-DC inverter based on a power balance achieved by an integral controller.

Code:
model IdealDcDc "Ideal DC-DC inverter"
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Time Td "Dead time";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Time Ti = 1e-6 "Time constant of integral power controller";
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sources.SignalVoltage signalVoltage ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sources.SignalCurrent signalCurrent ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sensors.PowerSensor powerBat ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Sensors.PowerSensor powerMot ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.FirstOrder deadTime(k = 1, initType = Modelica.Blocks.Types.Init.InitialOutput, y_start = 0, T = Td) ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Math.Feedback feedback ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Continuous.Integrator powerController(initType = Modelica.Blocks.Types.Init.InitialOutput, y_start = 0, k = 1 / Ti / unitVoltage) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Basic.Ground groundMotor ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.NegativePin pin_nBat ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.PositivePin pin_pBat ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.NegativePin pin_nMot ;
  Modelica.Electrical.Analog.Interfaces.PositivePin pin_pMot ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealInput vRef ;
protected
  constant Modelica.Units.SI.Voltage unitVoltage = 1 ;
equation
  connect(signalCurrent.p, powerBat.nc) ;
  connect(powerBat.pv, powerBat.pc) ;
  connect(signalVoltage.p, powerMot.pc) ;
  connect(powerMot.pc, powerMot.pv) ;
  connect(powerBat.power, feedback.u2) ;
  connect(powerMot.power, feedback.u1) ;
  connect(feedback.y, powerController.u) ;
  connect(powerController.y, signalCurrent.i) ;
  connect(pin_nBat, signalCurrent.n) ;
  connect(pin_pBat, powerBat.pc) ;
  connect(pin_nBat, powerBat.nv) ;
  connect(pin_nMot, powerMot.nv) ;
  connect(pin_pMot, powerMot.nc) ;
  connect(pin_nMot, groundMotor.p) ;
  connect(deadTime.y, signalVoltage.v) ;
  connect(vRef, deadTime.u) ;
  connect(signalVoltage.n, pin_nMot) ;

end IdealDcDc;

modelica://Modelica.Electrical/Switching:
