modelica://Modelica.Electrical/Transform:
Modelica.Electrical: TransformerData (record)

Basic parameters of transformers are predefined with default values.  
Note: ratio n is defined between primary / secondary line-to-line voltage; therefore the user has to take into account primary and secondary connection!

Code:
record TransformerData "Common parameters for transformers"
  extends Modelica.Icons.Record;
  parameter Real n_phase = 1 "Ratio primary voltage per phase / secondary voltage per phase";
  parameter String C1 = "Y" "Choose primary connection" ;
  parameter String C2 = "y" "Choose secondary connection" ;
  parameter Real n = n_phase * (if C1 == "D" and (C2 == "y" or C2 == "z") then 1 / sqrt(3) else if C1 == "Y" and C2 == "d" then sqrt(3) else 1) "Ratio primary voltage (line-to-line) / secondary voltage (line-to-line)" ;
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Resistance R1 = 5E-3 / 3 "Primary resistance per phase at TRef" ;
