modelica://Modelica.Electrical/ToSpacePh:
Modelica.Electrical: ToSpacePhasor (block)

Transformation of quasi-static polyphase values (voltages or currents) to space phasor and zero sequence value.

Code:
block ToSpacePhasor "Conversion: three-phase -> space phasor"
  extends Modelica.Blocks.Icons.Block;
  import Modelica.ComplexMath.j;
  import Modelica.ComplexMath.exp;
  import Modelica.ComplexMath.sum;
  parameter Integer m(min = 1) = 3 "Number of phases" ;
  Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Interfaces.ComplexInput u[m] ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealOutput y[2] ;
protected
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Angle phi[m] = Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Functions.symmetricOrientation(m);
  Complex c;
equation
  c = sqrt(2) / m * sum(array(u[k] * exp(j * phi[k]) for k in 1:m));
  y = {c.re, c.im};

end ToSpacePhasor;

modelica://Modelica.Electrical/FromSpace:
Modelica.Electrical: FromSpacePhasor (block)

Transformation of space phasor and zero sequence value to quasi-static polyphase values (voltages or currents).

Code:
block FromSpacePhasor "Conversion: space phasor -> three-phase"
  extends Modelica.Blocks.Icons.Block;
  import Modelica.ComplexMath.j;
  import Modelica.ComplexMath.exp;
  parameter Integer m(min = 1) = 3 "Number of phases" ;
  Modelica.Blocks.Interfaces.RealInput u[2] ;
  Modelica.ComplexBlocks.Interfaces.ComplexOutput y[m] ;
protected
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Angle phi[m] = Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Functions.symmetricOrientation(m);
equation
  y = array(Complex(u[1], u[2]) * exp(-j * phi[k]) / sqrt(2) for k in 1:m);

end FromSpacePhasor;

modelica://Modelica.Electrical/Balancing:
Modelica.Electrical: BalancingStar (model)

For the unsymmetrical load (resistor, capacitor and inductor) the parameters inductance L and capacitance C are chosen such way that the neutral current (see currentSensor0) is zero.   
 P.Vaske, Berechnung von Drehstromschaltungen (German, Calculation of polyphase circuits), Teubner 1973, page 42, example 18

Code:
model BalancingStar "Balancing an unsymmetrical star-connected load"
  extends Modelica.Icons.Example;
  constant Integer m = 3 "Number of phases";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Voltage V = 100 "Source Voltage";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Frequency f = 50 "Source frequency";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Resistance R = 10 "Load resistance";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Inductance L = R * sqrt(3) / (2 * Modelica.Constants.pi * f) "Load inductance";
  parameter Modelica.Units.SI.Capacitance C = 1 / (R * sqrt(3)) / (2 * Modelica.Constants.pi * f) "Load capacitance";
  output Modelica.Units.SI.ComplexCurrent i[m] = {resistor.i, inductor.i, capacitor.i} "Phase currents";
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Sources.VoltageSource voltageSource(m = m, f = f, V = fill(V, m), phi = -Modelica.Electrical.Polyphase.Functions.symmetricOrientation(m), gamma(fixed = true, start = 0)) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.Star star(m = m) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Ground ground ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.PlugToPin_p plugToPin_p1(m = m, k = 1) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.PlugToPin_p plugToPin_p2(k = 2, m = m) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.PlugToPin_p plugToPin_p3(k = 3, m = m) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Sensors.PowerSensor powerSensor(m = m) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Sensors.CurrentSensor currentSensor(m = m) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Resistor resistor(R_ref = R) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Capacitor capacitor(C = C) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Basic.Inductor inductor(L = L) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.Star star2(m = m) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.PlugToPin_n plugToPin_n1(m = m, k = 1) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.PlugToPin_n plugToPin_n2(k = 2, m = m) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.Polyphase.Basic.PlugToPin_n plugToPin_n3(k = 3, m = m) ;
  Modelica.Electrical.QuasiStatic.SinglePhase.Sensors.CurrentSensor currentSensor0 ;
  Modelica.ComplexBlocks.ComplexMath.ComplexToPolar complexToPolar[m] ;
equation
  connect(ground.pin, star.pin_n) ;
  connect(star.plug_p, voltageSource.plug_n) ;
  connect(voltageSource.plug_p, powerSensor.currentP) ;
  connect(powerSensor.currentN, currentSensor.plug_p) ;
  connect(powerSensor.voltageP, powerSensor.currentP) ;
  connect(powerSensor.voltageN, star.plug_p) ;
  connect(currentSensor.plug_n, plugToPin_p2.plug_p) ;
  connect(currentSensor.plug_n, plugToPin_p3.plug_p) ;
  connect(currentSensor.plug_n, plugToPin_p1.plug_p) ;
  connect(plugToPin_p1.pin_p, inductor.pin_p) ;
  connect(plugToPin_p2.pin_p, capacitor.pin_p) ;
  connect(plugToPin_p3.pin_p, resistor.pin_p) ;
  connect(inductor.pin_n, plugToPin_n1.pin_n) ;
  connect(capacitor.pin_n, plugToPin_n2.pin_n) ;
  connect(resistor.pin_n, plugToPin_n3.pin_n) ;
  connect(plugToPin_n1.plug_n, star2.plug_p) ;
  connect(plugToPin_n2.plug_n, star2.plug_p) ;
  connect(plugToPin_n3.plug_n, star2.plug_p) ;
  connect(star2.pin_n, currentSensor0.pin_p) ;
  connect(currentSensor0.pin_n, star.pin_n) ;
  connect(currentSensor.i, complexToPolar.u) ;

end BalancingStar;

