This is a partial function that defines the interface of valve characteristics. The function returns "rc = valveCharacteristic" as function of the opening "pos" (in the range 0..1):     dp = (zeta_TOT/2) * rho * velocity^2 m_flow = sqrt(2/zeta_TOT) * Av * sqrt(rho * dp) m_flow = valveCharacteristic * Av * sqrt(rho * dp) m_flow = rc * Av * sqrt(rho * dp)

