      = 0.5*zeta/A^2 *1/rho * m_flow * |m_flow|
      = k/rho * m_flow * |m_flow|
   k  = 0.5*zeta/A^2
      = 0.5*zeta/(pi*(D/2)^2)^2
      = 8*zeta/(pi*D^2)^2
   m_flow_turbulent = (pi/4)*D_Re*mu*Re_turbulent
   dp_turbulent     =  k/rho *(D_Re*mu*pi/4)^2 * Re_turbulent^2

